    "body": "Good catch. This is probably historical. I think we should keep the sentence saying that you must not use the legacy values though. Or maybe move it to a note inside the algorithm step 2.2.1 saying \"This step will allow the legacy values never, default, and always, but per the above conformance requirement, authors must not use these\".\n",
